   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Initial mirt() use `MHRM` method,I don&#39;t know `SE=TRUE` should be passed.  <br></div><div>In help(Wald),<span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(30,30,30);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline!important;float:none\">Requires that the model information matrix be computed (including<span> </span></span><code style=\"background:none rgb(30,30,30);color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:13.3333px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">SE = TRUE</code><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(30,30,30);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline!important;float:none\"><span> </span>when using the EM method).</span></div></div>"
    ],
    [
